# Corpus and candidate findings.
#
# These are DERIVED artifacts that embed the full source diffs of whatever
# repository they were captured from, plus unfixed security findings about it.
# Capturing from a private repo means this file carries someone else's private
# code, so it is never committed. Rebuild with:
#   pr-reviewer benchmark-capture --repo <owner/name> <pr numbers...>
corpus.json
candidates.json

